Package: halos-halpi2-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         halos-halpi2,
         halos-desktop,
         halos-halpi-desktop-branding
Description: HALPI2 desktop variant metapackage
 Marks a HaLOS installation as a HALPI2 desktop variant and pulls in
 the HALPI2-branded wallpaper. Future HALPI2-only desktop content will
 be added as dependencies here.
